---
title: Simulation Mode Data Flow
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph Sources["Data Sources"]
        A[Replay Mode:\nrecorded plate images\n+ LiDAR point clouds\nfrom .pcap/.pcd files]
        B[Synthetic Mode:\ngenerated Kenyan plates\n+ procedural 3D\nvehicle point clouds]
        C[HIL Mode:\nreal camera + LiDAR\nhardware connected\nvia USB passthrough]
    end

    subgraph HAL["Hardware Abstraction Layer"]
        D[Camera HAL Interface]
        E[LiDAR HAL Interface]
        F[Gate Relay HAL Interface]
    end

    A --> D
    A --> E
    B --> D
    B --> E
    C --> D
    C --> E

    D --> G[ALPR Pipeline\nsame code path\nas production]
    E --> H[LiDAR Pipeline\nsame code path\nas production]

    G --> I[Decision Fusion\nsame code path]
    H --> I

    I --> J[Gate Command]
    J --> F

    F --> K{Mode?}
    K -- Simulation --> L[Virtual gate:\nlog state transitions\nno physical actuation]
    K -- HIL --> M[Real gate relay:\nactual motor control]
    K -- Replay --> L

    L --> N[Dashboard:\nshows simulated events\nwith SIM badge]
    M --> N

    subgraph Validation["Test Validation"]
        O[Compare decisions\nagainst ground truth\nlabels if available]
        P[Measure latency\nper pipeline stage]
        Q[Generate accuracy\nreport: precision,\nrecall, F1]
    end

    L --> O
    L --> P
    O --> Q

    style A fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style B fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style C fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style G fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style H fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style I fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
